# Local production-art source packs
# Some third-party art licenses permit incorporation into the built game while restricting
# redistribution of the raw asset files. Keep the source drop private/local and use the
# editor ingestion seam in ExternalArtDropV09.cs.
unity/Assets/Mindforge/LocalArt/

# V0.29 playable external chassis.
# The complete Dragon Souls project is materialized at an immutable commit by
# tools/bootstrap_dragonsouls_chassis.sh. It contains a large mixed-provenance
# third-party art/audio graph, so the raw checkout remains local until individual
# asset families are audited or replaced.
external/DragonSouls-Unity3D/

